   "section": "listening",
   "speaker": "Markus",
   "accent": "German",
   "voice_id": null,
   "model_id": null,
   "text": "That evening I asked my mother. She looked at the floor. By the time I asked her, she had known for six months. The company had closed in January. My father had left the house every morning with his bag, and he had come back at seven, every day.",
   "chars": 245,
   "status": "pendiente"
  },
  {
