   "section": "listening",
   "speaker": "Markus",
   "accent": "German",
   "voice_id": null,
   "model_id": null,
   "text": "I was angry for one week. Then I understood something. He had not lied to protect himself. He had lied because he had promised me a university year, and he had already paid it before the company closed. We still talk about that Tuesday.",
   "chars": 236,
   "status": "pendiente"
  },
  {
